    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghweelmoojiga diini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eeshiina fuga Israeli, Ghweelmoojiga siloat bea NG'UTAMIIDA jea anung' ghwayiiy buuneeda gideaba ea ghaydidi jea eebata geadi, ghweelmoojigeasu suh gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajagadiyeena eawooji lah; ama eaweeteaba ispwa ea sabaatoheeda jea eefuufa, eaweeda ghaydit jea eebada geadi; majasna gadiyeeda; nih sabaatoheeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba jeeda giibindeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Suh ghweelmoojiga siloat bea NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ea ghaydit nea geebada geadi, jea arukwiida damanda siloat aba badahuukeagwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Basaaka ea Mukaateeyda meamwatawiida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eeshiina fuga Israeli, Iyoapkaanyi jeeda ng'eanyiida eagoonyeegwa ak ghoalaji boagaaschi, gajayeani muschoonga was haghweega madeeda bea boogeagwa heeda ashoohoocheanda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaygagatkat muschoonga aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak abeeda geamwaseagwa; ama muchu nea ning'ata sabaato abeeda gaygagatkat ashoohoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea eaweeda igatkadi muschoonga, gajadayda gisilleanda was lagweenda bea gwanyagi maba bada ghoah haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda bea NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea booga ghadooweeda gajea haleanji iyeenya gil aba jeeda gea atamanamughuush bea eefayda dearanga miyaasiin guuyi nagheeda, jea eaghwarda bea NG'UTAMIIDA, ghoah shearooda ng'andit; ea haleanjeeda sileeha bea ghadooweeda was difaayi, was gideaba ang'wan bea hiina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea majaga mukaate ghana ea booga siikghwareasan ghana ea shabeadi ea ghwahita eaweecheanji, ea eaghus ea nooyeadu haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea ASEETEANG'WA: nih deaweeda gil ea ghoah damanda manda muudeanooda aba jeeda seaygoojigeagwa aba jeeda giibindeang'wa sean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghweelmeeda lajita booga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak gajayiita ghang'eada eaweeda ng'ataawa sabaato, ghang'eada eaweeda ooyeani muschoonga sigatgat was haleanjeeda ghadooweeda; wiikaji ispwa muguuri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayiita eawooji haradam ea damanamughuush iing'ata sabaatoheedeaba ispwa; abeeda gajayaada haleanjeeda ghadooweeda was booga heas heeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajayeanana heeda oopiiti mukaataji iyeenya hees jea eegatkat, sisna giloohaji iyeenya bea eefa, gajeesna dearanga miyaas, ak gajeewoolsiinyi gidamwataw ghoah haghweega madeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeaduudayeewana mukaate ea dayi ispwa bea gisilga bea nih bea gwanyagi biissa ea manda sirjeeda, ea jurukuta mwanang', ea lagweendi iyeenya; ak gayghoah haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda bea NG'UTAMIIDA, sea booga nyaawa bea ghadooweeda ea haleanjeeda nyaawa sileeha bea ghadooweeda, was haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda, was shearooda ng'andit bea NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajadayda ghwaranyagi bea nooga sighadoawanda aba badayda riing'eeda, ea lagweendi iyeenya bea nih bea gwanyagi ghoah lukghumeeda hoyyoo sighadoawanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaygageanu ashoohoocheanda ak gagatkat sea mukaateeyda booga madeeda ghoah haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sigatkat aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, sea gisilga asiyeenya; suh gajea ghaydidi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda ashoohoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak abeeda gajabwada geat aba eaweecheanji; nea badoodeang'wa bea geat gajea ghaydit; majasna gadiyeeda: nih deaweeda gil aba damanda manda muudeanooda aba jeeda giibindeang'wa aba jeeda seaygoojigeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iimuchu nea ghoalaji booga ng'eanyiideang'wa, nea majalaja madameegeagwa ea gwaduulean, ak ea mwajeawaamwa gheaptanga iing'ata lajita boogeagwa; gajoopuusiina fuga barbari ea rabascheanda: Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghweelmeeda gweayda eesh",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
