          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eeshiina fuga Israeli, aba eaweeda madeeda bea sheedeaba ispwa, gajea eaweeda fuufta gil, nea ghoapkaachi ghuudita durumbeatajeega ajuur, nih badoodeaba geat ghaydidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Majasna gadiyeeda; ak gajeatayda haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda bea NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eaweeda giiduupcheeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eaweeteaba damanamughuush bea sheedeaba ispwa gajea eaweeda giiduupcheeda; gayghoah aba heedeang'wa eaweeda ghaydit bea badoodeaba geat, ak gajarada jalooda nea ghoataydi haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda bea NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eaweecheanji ea majasna gadiyeeda; aba gideaba eaweeda giiduupcheeda, sisin giiduupcheeda aba badahuukeagwa aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba siida wassean mwarada jalooda aba eaweecheanji gajeasach aba jeeda fugaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida wassean sin gadiyeeda wassean eaweecheanji, siidida gaydabwar aba jeeda fugaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Majasna gadiyeeda: nih deaweeda gil ea ghoah damanda manda muudeanooda aba jeeda seaygoojigeagwa aba jeeda giibindeang'wa sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
