          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Suh eawoojiga ghweelmooji siloat bea NG'UTAMIIDA, jea eang'waanya damanyoojiga badoodeaba geat ghaydit, iyoayaachi haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, was haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda ea booga sighadoawanda, ea lukghumajeega ea haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sileeha, nea gaba nih bea eaweadaanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geabwada sabaatoheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, haleanjeedeang'wa oataydi, ea haleanjeedeang'wa was radanga, ea haleanjeedeang'wa oataydi nea googasayi bea ghadooweeda, eatawji NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eaweeteaba damanamuut bea sheedeaba ispwa, iing'ata giiweamda haleanjeeda jih ng'eanyiida, gajeang'waanya ghweelmeeda NG'UTAMIIDA eawooji ispwa; eaweeda madeeda gajea dea fuufta, nea eaweeteaba sis gajea dea fuufta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak abeeda gajanyaksiina geat eaweeda madeeda haghweega geediga miyaas, ea damealga miilayga, ea geediga durumani sean, ea seenga deakghweeda abiita ghuuta eenda; ak gajahoosana aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA eawooji ispwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeang'waanya ghoah ghweelmeeda NG'UTAMIIDA eawooji ispwa aba jeeda gweayda; nih gayghoah deaweeda manda muudeanooda aba jeeda seaygoojigaagu; gajeang'waanya aba sheedeaba ispwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajoopiidana jeesinga udahabeaschajeega eawooji ispwa; buuneesean bea ng'eanyiida Israeli gaygoobiida jeesinga udahabeaschajeega, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak abeeda ghwanal seaygoojigeagwa gideaba aniini ghaanung' goobiida fuga Israeli jeesinga udahabeaschajeega damanda earuuni saawa ng'eanyiida Misri: Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
